Package: tokenbridge
Type: Package
Title: TokenBridge Client for Health API Research
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Jack", "Manners", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "jack.manners@flinders.edu.au")
Description: Lightweight R client for TokenBridge, a self-hosted OAuth token
    manager for health data research. Provides auth-link generation and
    token retrieval only; call the provider's own API directly with the
    token. For a built-in data-fetching convenience layer, see the Python
    package instead.
